                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99e2133e-5903-441b-ac18-cdccdac58b35",
                                                "sense_id": "b8e6ad7e-9049-3d38-9858-0ea4b7d60c25",
                                                "text": "The Besht preached that the simple man, imbued with native faith and able to pray fervently and wholeheartedly with a sense of joy in his heart, was nearer and dearer to God than the learned but joyless formalist spending his whole life in the study of Talmud."
